{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个曾在亲近关系中受委屈的人选择离开，却发现离开后虽然不必再忍受委屈，也失去了熟悉的陪伴和自在。他始终怀念过去的温暖，又害怕重新受伤，最后决定既不否认想念，也不再否定自己离开的理由，带着这份矛盾继续生活。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"离开后空落迷惘\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"怀念旧日仍记委屈\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近的快乐仍在\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"盼亲近又疑离开\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"维护自己却只剩难受\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"想念有人相伴\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"离开后孤单不愿再忍\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"回忆只够片刻喘息\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"分不清想念还是怕孤单\",\n      \"echo\": \"S08\",\n      \"why\": \"不能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"舍不得亲近忘不了委屈\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"害怕仍在脚步向前\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近委屈都承认\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"珍惜亲近也坚持向前\",\n      \"echo\": \"S12\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S03，停留时间不长，短词又密集，情绪在怀念、愤怒、焦躁和心酸之间不断切换，不容易一下抓住重点。最抓人的是 S07 到 S13：孤独感突然变得具体，最后又从反复挣扎走向一种平静而坚定的选择——可以怀念过去，但不必为了找回亲近而重新忍受委屈。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9e1cdb43-0b4c-40a4-be56-43c777417b61", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T185633142267Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.172, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T18:57:30.330334+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cc068ae37252f9806b452a41596ac886ed8cfd196b1f36edcc2288cbb09bbc52", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T185633142267Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b45cd39aca4775499754d3f74791274bd6e874bb71fff59388736f7c7ec9cb06"}}}
